        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://private-avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5892127?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTEiLCJleHAiOjE3MzQ2NDgwMDAsIm5iZiI6MTczNDY0NjgwMCwicGF0aCI6Ii91LzU4OTIxMjcifQ.7Isla4AdeImSfOW3qn5zxbu0EUyCmaaBIBmY7sFe9Vk&u=20a6c16972e912ed6515cb106393c62659f203de&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Patches the following packages to point to .NET 8.0:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">alttpr-opentracker</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746631073\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/trippsc2/OpenTracker/issues/93\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/trippsc2/OpenTracker/issues/93/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/trippsc2/OpenTracker/issues/93\">trippsc2/OpenTracker#93</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">am2rlauncher</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746634147\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/AM2R-Community-Developers/AM2RLauncher/issues/93\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/AM2R-Community-Developers/AM2RLauncher/issues/93/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/AM2R-Community-Developers/AM2RLauncher/issues/93\">AM2R-Community-Developers/AM2RLauncher#93</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">avalonia-ilspy</code>: (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746751627\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/AvaloniaILSpy/issues/151\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/icsharpcode/AvaloniaILSpy/issues/151/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/AvaloniaILSpy/issues/151\">icsharpcode/AvaloniaILSpy#151</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">clr-loader</code> (no issue upstream because they're just sample projects and not actually built)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">dafny</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2069005729\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/dafny-lang/dafny/issues/4948\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/dafny-lang/dafny/issues/4948/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/dafny-lang/dafny/issues/4948\">dafny-lang/dafny#4948</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">formula</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746638675\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/VUISIS/formula-dotnet/issues/42\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/VUISIS/formula-dotnet/issues/42/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/VUISIS/formula-dotnet/issues/42\">VUISIS/formula-dotnet#42</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">inklecate</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746620806\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/inkle/ink/issues/922\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/inkle/ink/issues/922/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/inkle/ink/issues/922\">inkle/ink#922</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">knossosnet</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746642029\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/KnossosNET/Knossos.NET/issues/259\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/KnossosNET/Knossos.NET/issues/259/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/KnossosNET/Knossos.NET/issues/259\">KnossosNET/Knossos.NET#259</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The following have been upgraded to a new version that has support for a newer .NET:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">gh-gei</code> (first version with .NET 8 support is v1.10.1, but might as well upgrade to latest while I'm at it):\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.10.0\">https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.10.0</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.10.1\">https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.10.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.11.0\">https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.11.0</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">ilspycmd</code> (upgrade to preview version was needed because it's the only one that has .NET 8 support):\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.1\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.1.1\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.1.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.2\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview1\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview2\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview3\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview3</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2403468389\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/326335\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\